<div style="padding: 30px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
    <!-- Heading -->
    <h1 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        Subscription Canceled
    </h1>

    <!-- Greeting -->
    <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        Hey <strong>{{fullName}}</strong>,
    </p>

    <!-- Main message -->
    <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        Your subscription has been canceled. We're sorry to see you go and hope you'll consider 
        rejoining us in the future.
    </p>

    <!-- What happens next -->
    <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        If you change your mind or have any questions about your cancellation, 
        you can manage your subscription or contact our support team.
    </p>

    <!-- Button -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
        {{> button url=link text="Manage Subscription" }}
    </div>

    <!-- Fallback link -->
    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #555; word-break: break-all; margin: 20px 0;">
        If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:<br />
        <a href="{{link}}" style="color: #272EA7;">{{link}}</a>
    </p>

    <!-- Feedback request -->
    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #555; margin: 20px 0;">
        We'd love to hear your feedback about your experience. Your input helps us improve our service.
    </p>

    <!-- Sign off -->
    <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 14px;">
        The CosmicForge Team
    </p>

</div>